ASSIGN
b-add :MENU-MOUSE in frame Dialog-Frame= 1.
if v-db-num <> 0 then do:
    menu-item m_global:sensitive in menu MENU-B-add = no  .
    menu-item m_host:sensitive in menu MENU-B-add = no  .
end.
